{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed `legacy_flat_fee` and its pricing logic. Both `calculate_order_totals` and `place_order` now raise `TypeError` when passed the removed keyword.\n\nThe optional `audit_sink` receives one event before each new order charge, upgrade, or refund commits. Idempotent replays skip the sink. If the sink raises, its exception propagates and the order, subscription change, ledger entry, and idempotency record remain uncommitted. Failed attempts can leave gaps in generated IDs.\n\n`run_checks.py` exited 0 with all 28 tests passing."}}
